  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Sugar, Spice, and the Not So Nice (2023), published by Leuven University Press, has no recorded citations yet, but it has been downloaded 2,240 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Sugar, Spice, and the Not So Nice by Dona Pursall and Eva Van de Wiele was published by Leuven University Press in 2023. Conceptually, the work connects to Comics, Scholarship, Appeal, Identity (music) and Infographic.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records no citations for the book so far.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It has been downloaded 2,240 times via OAPEN. Its subject matter aligns with Gender equality among the Sustainable Development Goals.</p>",
